      "featured_image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/0251/7500/files/4_3_ueno_01.jpg?v=1754391156",
      "description_html": "<p class=\"generic-text  padding-line-element\">The Ueno screen, in line with the Timeout collection, is characterised by its burnished metal frame and hand-woven polypropylene cord in the colour anthracite. A decorative element that helps modulate the space, adding a discreet touch of style to every outdoor environment.</p>\n<div class=\"show-for-mobile  padding-line-element\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<section id=\"block-0\" class=\"content-block dimension-medium\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content\">\n<div class=\"block-text block-text__align-left  row animation-y\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">Thanks to its interplay of material and structural references, it can be used both with the elements of the Timeout Collection and with the entire Outdoor Collection. In addition to the screen, the range includes a large array of products, such as the sofa, the dining table with seats, the comfortable lounger, side tables, stools and bench.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"block-2\" class=\"content-block dimension-medium  block-designer-2\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content  row  designer-2-flex\">\n<div class=\"designer-2-text\">\n<div class=\"block-designer-abstract-bio  animation-y\">\n<article>\n<div class=\"designer-2-content-name\"><br></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>"
